    "text": "A person goes to the office either by a car, or scooter, or bus, the probability of which being <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> respectively. The probability that he reaches office late if he takes a car, or scooter, or bus is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> respectively. If he reaches office in time, the probability that he travelled by car is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mn>24</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math> is equal to",
