    "text": "Let, <math><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>S</mi></math> be the events such that a person goes to the office by car, bus or scooter respectively.<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>T</mi></math> be the event that he reaches office in time<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|